      "content": "but i've had a migraine that felt similar once before and i just took some extra sumatriptan and slept it off. its like a pressure feeling in the back of my head too. i dont want to sit in the waiting room for 6 hours if it's just gonna be a migraine again. do you think it's safe to just take another dose and wait a bit to see if it fades?",
